1.2 depants if it's for the current implamation of stockserver or the updated one (the version of stockserver that includes set/update)
if it's for the original stockserver then immutable is better because the server only allows reading of it and there's nothing that can change , the data is static
but if we talking about the later version of stockserver with the update function then it's to sync the critical parts of the server (which would be the read funcions of the price and the update price)
so for option A would be the best for the original stockserver

